@startuml system-workflow-simple
title Docling Studio — Workflow (simplified)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7E0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0C46C

actor "User" as User
participant "Web UI" as UI #E8F5E9
participant "Converter" as Conv #FFF3E0
database "Markdown corpus" as Files #ECEFF1
participant "RAG engine" as RAG #F3E5F5
boundary "Ollama bge-m3\n(local)" as Ollama #ECEFF1
database "PostgreSQL\n(pgvector)" as PG #ECEFF1
boundary "Anthropic Claude" as Claude #ECEFF1
participant "Graph engine" as KG #E3F2FD

== Step 1 — Upload and convert ==
User -> UI : drops **Workshop.pptx**
UI -> Conv : convert
Conv -> Conv : Docling + OCR → **Markdown**
Conv -> Files : output.md

== Step 2 — Chunk, embed, store ==
UI -> RAG : embed the Markdown
RAG -> Files : read .md
RAG -> RAG : split into **chunks**
RAG -> Ollama : embed chunks (local)
Ollama --> RAG : 1024-d vectors
RAG -> PG : store chunks + vectors

== Step 3 — Ask RAG ==
User -> UI : "Who validated 7.1.12.3?"
UI -> RAG : ask (SSE)
RAG -> PG : vector + keyword search
PG --> RAG : **top-k chunks**
RAG -> Claude : excerpts + question
Claude --> RAG : answer tokens
UI --> User : 💬 answer with [n] citations

== Step 4 — Ask the graph ==
User -> UI : "How does eCommerce connect to S/4HANA?"
UI -> KG : query_graph()
KG -> Files : read the **same** .md corpus
KG -> KG : BFS + 2-hop expansion
KG --> User : 🕸️ hop-by-hop path (no LLM, no SQL)

note across
  Two engines over one corpus. RAG retrieves (vector + BM25, fused) and lets
  Claude write a cited answer; the graph engine traverses and answers from
  structure alone. Embedding runs locally on Ollama.
  Full sequence: system-workflow.png
end note

@enduml
